@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy | D2DJobs";
    ViewData["MetaDescription"] = "Read the D2DJobs privacy policy and how we handle user information.";
}

<div class="container py-5 legal-page">

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
        D2DJobs respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle
        information when users visit our website.
    </p>

    <h3>Information We Collect</h3>

    <p>
        D2DJobs does not collect resume, application, or sensitive candidate data.
        When users click the Apply button, they are redirected to the official company
        or job provider website.
    </p>

    <p>
        We may collect basic non-personal information such as browser type, device type,
        pages visited, and general usage data to improve website performance and user experience.
    </p>

    <h3>How We Use Information</h3>

    <p>
        We use basic website usage information to improve job listings, search experience,
        website speed, content quality, and overall user experience.
    </p>

    <p>We keep daily aggregate counts of public page requests to understand site usage. This counter does not store IP addresses, visitor identifiers or analytics cookies. Repeat requests and automated traffic may be included.</p>
    <h3>Advertisements</h3>

    <p>
        D2DJobs may display third-party advertisements, including Google AdSense or
        similar advertising networks. These advertising partners may use cookies to display
        relevant ads based on user interests and browsing activity.
    </p>

    <h3>External Links</h3>

    <p>
        Our website may contain links to official company websites, job portals, or third-party
        platforms. D2DJobs is not responsible for the privacy practices or content of
        external websites.
    </p>

    <h3>Data Protection</h3>

    <p>
        We do not sell personal information. Since applications are completed on external
        official websites, users should review the privacy policies of those external platforms
        before submitting any personal information.
    </p>

    <h3>Contact</h3>

    <p>
        For privacy-related questions, users can contact us through the Contact page.
    </p>

</div>